  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The acquisition of nutrient concentration data in the water column all over the Beaufort Sea is crucial to evaluate the interannual variability of these nutrients in this peculiar region. The resulting nutrient distribution will also help identify supply sources of each studied nutrient as well as it will help quantify the effects of biological processes (e.g. uptake/release, nitrification, ammonification, etc.)."
